el('notammanual').onchange=()=>{manualNotamSignature=el('notammanual').checked?manualSignature():'';manualNotamAt=el('notammanual').checked?new Date().toISOString():null;invalidate();refreshView();reset(1);window.updateFlightdeskDecision?.();};
el('airspacerefresh').onclick=()=>load({manual:true});for(const id of ['missionradius','notamterrain','notamterrainref']){const finish=()=>{clearTimeout(viewTimer);viewTimer=null;refreshView();reset(1);};el(id).addEventListener('input',()=>{invalidate();el('check1').checked=false;el('checked1').textContent='';el('finalconfirm').checked=false;el('notammanual').checked=false;manualNotamSignature='';manualNotamAt=null;clearTimeout(viewTimer);viewTimer=setTimeout(finish,350);});el(id).addEventListener('change',finish);}el('airspacereviewed').onchange=()=>{reviewedSignature=el('airspacereviewed').checked?signature():'';if(!el('airspacereviewed').checked)reset(1);window.updateFlightdeskDecision?.();};
el('briefingref').addEventListener('input',()=>{clearTimeout(viewTimer);viewTimer=setTimeout(()=>{refreshView();window.updateFlightdeskDecision?.();},350);});el('briefingref').addEventListener('change',()=>{clearTimeout(viewTimer);refreshView();window.updateFlightdeskDecision?.();});
el('importpib').onchange=async e=>{const f=e.target.files?.[0];if(!f)return;try{if(f.size>10*1024*1024)throw Error('PIB is larger than 10 MB');const feed=parsePib({xml:await f.text(),source:'Pilot-imported full PIB XML',publisher:'Pilot-imported PIB — verify origin',retrievedAt:new Date().toISOString(),mirror:false});notamFeed=feed;notamRecords=feed.records;notamRequest={...notamRequest,state:'succeeded',manual:true,startedAt:new Date().toISOString(),finishedAt:new Date().toISOString(),error:null};errors=errors.filter(t=>!t.startsWith('notams:'));invalidate();refreshView();window.updateFlightdeskDecision?.();}catch(error){notamRequest={...notamRequest,state:'failed',finishedAt:new Date().toISOString(),error:'PIB import rejected: '+error.message};refreshView();window.updateFlightdeskDecision?.();}finally{e.target.value='';}};
const beforeSelect=select;select=function(...args){if(!site||site.lat!==args[0]||site.lon!==args[1]){el('notamterrain').value='';el('notamterrainref').value='';}beforeSelect(...args);invalidate();lastSelection=JSON.stringify([site?.lat,site?.lon]);if(!loaded)load();else refreshView();};
